WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.992
Here is a strategy with no skill

2
00:00:02.992 --> 00:00:06.435
at all. Its path is pure chance.

3
00:00:06.735 --> 00:00:07.888
One simulated path,

4
00:00:07.888 --> 00:00:09.427
as bumpy as carry.

5
00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:11.715
It wanders by luck.

6
00:00:12.015 --> 00:00:13.169
Ten of them.

7
00:00:13.169 --> 00:00:14.323
Some end up,

8
00:00:14.323 --> 00:00:15.842
some down.

9
00:00:16.142 --> 00:00:17.296
Thirty-nine of them,

10
00:00:17.296 --> 00:00:19.988
one for each idea Parity counted in

11
00:00:19.988 --> 00:00:22.277
its first official run.

12
00:00:22.577 --> 00:00:25.635
The luckiest one ends at $148.

13
00:00:25.935 --> 00:00:28.627
Now carry's real record over the same

14
00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:30.915
years: $100 became $149.

15
00:00:31.215 --> 00:00:33.908
Carry ends one dollar above the best

16
00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:35.427
no-skill path.

17
00:00:35.727 --> 00:00:36.881
On a chart,

18
00:00:36.881 --> 00:00:41.338
luck and skill look the same.
